College Name: MIT World Peace University

Complaint Categories:
1. Hostel Issues – Room, food, water, electricity
2. Library Issues – Books, seating, timing
3. Academic Issues – Faculty, syllabus, exams
4. Infrastructure Issues – WiFi, labs, classrooms
5. Cleanliness Issues – Washrooms, campus hygiene

Complaint Process:
1. Student logs into ResolveIQ
2. Student submits complaint with category and details
3. Admin reviews complaint
4. Complaint assigned to respective department
5. Department resolves complaint
6. Student can track status
7. Student can rate complaint after resolution

Important Features:
- Students can track complaint status (Pending, In Progress, Resolved)
- Students can reopen complaint if not satisfied
- Students can rate complaint resolution